{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"alpha investing feature selection alpha investing feature selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","fileName":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 21:00\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Classification Feature Selection]] · [[Streaming Feature Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Classification Feature Selection","Streaming Feature Engineering","dataclassification.pdf","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"alpha investing feature selection alpha investing feature selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","fileName":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection","heading":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Alpha-investing feature selection treats sequential feature tests as investments from a changing statistical wealth. Accepting a useful feature can replenish the budget, while testing candidates spends it.\n\nThe procedure is suited to streaming dimensions because it makes an immediate inclusion decision while controlling the accumulation of false discoveries. Its behavior depends on the order of arriving features and on how aggressively the available testing wealth is allocated.\n\nIn streaming feature engineering, alpha-investing provides a principled stopping and acceptance mechanism when the number of future candidates is unknown. Statistical wealth links each decision to the history of earlier tests.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Classification Feature Selection","Streaming Feature Engineering","dataclassification.pdf","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"alpha investing feature selection alpha investing feature selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","fileName":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Alpha-Investing Feature Selection","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[dataclassification.pdf]]\n\n[[featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Classification Feature Selection","Streaming Feature Engineering","dataclassification.pdf","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}